<title>ISRAEL: TENNIS-ISRAELI OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ISRAELI OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the $328,000 Israeli</p>
<p>Open tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>4-Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Nir Welgreen (Israel) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-MaliVai Washington (U.S.) beat Martin Sinner (Germany) 6-1</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>7-Grant Stafford (South Africa) beat Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil)</p>
<p>6-4 6-3</p>
<p>5-Hernan Gumy (Argentina) beat Richard Fromberg (Australia) 6-4</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Marcos Ondruska (South Africa) beat 3-Felix Mantilla (Spain)</p>
<p>7-5 6-4</p>
</text>
